<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Xerox cut by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Xerox cut by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it cut its rating of Xerox Corp to near-term neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Xerox closed at 57 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Dan Mandresh was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Xerox posted third quarter earnings per share of $0.68, up from $0.65 a year ago. First Call had put analysts' consensus estimate at $0.82.</p>
</text>
